{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>And My servant Caleb.</b> He is mentioned alone because of ' Caleb silenced' [ויהס כלב]. And the Levites and the priests are not included in the oath, for no spy-prince went from among them — and furthermore, 'according to all your counts, according to all your number,' even though the priests and also the Levites were numerous." "<b>A different spirit.</b> Corresponding to 'they spread a report' [התרים]." "<b>And he followed after Me.</b> He pursued after My words and fulfilled it, that the land is very good and there is no slander."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:17:39.299091447Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}